<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109845" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑφήγ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leading, guidance,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Puer.</u>
				18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				267.13
			</span></i> (Pergam., <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				827 iii 4
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">ii A. D.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ὁδοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					3.95
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὴν ὑ. τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.151
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.Al.</u>
				1420b25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.27.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γράφειν κατὰ τὴν ὑ. τῶν
			γραμμῶν</span> by the <i>guiding pattern</i> of lines, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				326d
			</span></i>; <i>sketch, outline</i> of a subject, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>Libr.Propr.Praef.</u>
			</span></i>(pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>direction,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				<u>Praef.</u>
				3
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>VP</u>
				21.96
			</span></i>:—in <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				7.24.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπήχησις</span> is prob. cj.</div>
